{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56541","headline":"还丹歌 十 · 杨行真人","name":"还丹歌 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汞结本在丹田中，次居阳鼎炁相通。\n和合三朝方始住，还知大药在铅中。\n先入阴鑪成大白，後居阳鼎变金丹。\n世人若达其中理，水银被制不爲难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨行真人","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56541.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56541","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}